1. This project is based on "SAI Pen Pressure" by ametrien
================================================================================

The Windows-side pressure bridge in this repository — `bridge/wintab32.c`,
`bridge/wintab_core.h`, `bridge/wintab32.def`, and the prebuilt
`dist/wintab32.dll` / `dist/wtprobe.exe` built from them — is a **modified
version** of code from:

    SAI Pen Pressure
    Copyright 2026 ametrien
    https://github.com/ametrien/Paint-Tool-SAI-pen-pressure-macOS-fix

`android/SaiPressureBridge.java` is likewise a port of that project's macOS
helper to Android.

**Changes (made 2026-11-17 / 2026-11-18):** the DLL is cross-compiled for the
Winlator Wine prefix instead of macOS; the macOS helper is replaced by an
Android-side sender that is patched into Winlator's `TouchpadView`
(`android/PenBridge.java`); the wire protocol is unchanged
(`"seq pressure x y w h"` over UDP `127.0.0.1:47800`). Nothing in this
repository is the original SAI Pen Pressure, and ametrien did not write it.

